<title>UK: LIFFE appoints managing director of technology.</title>
<headline>LIFFE appoints managing director of technology.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) said on Wednesday it appointed Simon Orebi Gann as managing director of technology.</p>
<p>Gann joins LIFFE from Marks and Spencer Plc where he was executive, information technology, responsible for IT for food business and technology strategy.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
